{"title":"2009 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Solution_.28credit_to_Moonmathpi496.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(credit_to_Moonmathpi496)\">Solution (credit to Moonmathpi496)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (credit to Moonmathpi496)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Draw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7a248cfd02095e2a009f811d5732a9bea9d595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d74d8c04521019a3aa266281ebe0a4ca3b54df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GH \\parallel BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7a248cfd02095e2a009f811d5732a9bea9d595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> passes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.  By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AA_Similarity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AA Similarity\">AA Similarity</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/297d40e676fcb2f8315f18904692bf932d5bda12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AGP \\sim \\triangle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/f/7ef1d7e09714fd7ed4c02a47a08035579b5b0702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APH \\sim \\triangle ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4160f3570176d9561018453b25524dca462298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{GP}{BD}=\\frac{AP}{AD}=\\frac{PH}{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"153\" height=\"39\" />. This also means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59a6bdc7be911bd7232739b6f3d5f9241beb8a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{GP}{PH}=\\frac{BD}{DC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/a/2caf3459283d7f05855bb1a07227963cd37fa998.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair B=(0,0),A=(80,90),C=(100,0),D=(50,0),P=(60,30); pair g=(80/3,30),h=(280/3,30); draw(A--B--C--A); draw(A--D); draw(g--h); dot(P); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$G$&quot;,g,W); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,h,E); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,NW); draw((8,9)--(90.58824,42.35294)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(8,9),W); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,(90.58824,42.35294),E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"232\" />\n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Menelaus%27_Theorem\" title=\"Menelaus&#39; Theorem\">Menelaus' Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/a/b1a5939e4ca58766f1cfeeafbd9d5b55d75a05f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{HE}{EA}\\cdot\\frac{AF}{FG}\\cdot\\frac{GP}{PH}=\\frac{HE}{EA}\\cdot\\frac{AF}{FG}\\cdot\\frac{BD}{DC}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"316\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/6/c66349c1d8fc53df78159e398380df1d72dce119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AE+EH}{AC}=\\frac{AP}{AD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"39\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859257fd59e79bb791a65f15562c1d9929e096a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AF-GF}{AB}=\\frac{AP}{AD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b19c0bfdec36082e8da6e7ba3a3149b69fa63c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EH$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/857df29da7da4f8eadf2d2481dc811df53738580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> yields \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/e/0fe1f1974c5273b985f7f0396f9adec852ec88ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[EH=\\frac{AP\\cdot AC-AE\\cdot AD}{AD}\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/a/f9aa6619d32939855348a8499cd5572d0151bb6f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[GF=\\frac{AF\\cdot AD-AP\\cdot AB}{AD}\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"37\" />\nPlugging these into the Menelaus's equation above yields\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/9/f39ec21e1ae463305fcbadc62e98d5a5d13fe972.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AP\\cdot AC-AE\\cdot AD}{AD\\cdot EA}\\cdot \\frac{AF\\cdot AD}{AF\\cdot AD-AP\\cdot AB}\\cdot \\frac{BD}{DC}=1\\]\" width=\"422\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b8089b60eaea18b039f7aac60851413c4fd6c63.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AP\\cdot AC\\cdot AF\\cdot BD - AE\\cdot AD\\cdot AF\\cdot BD = EA\\cdot AF\\cdot AD\\cdot DC -EA\\cdot AP\\cdot AB\\cdot DC\\]\" width=\"570\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b36a52f6b482e21fa1f6c4aaaf3c91865f0f942e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AB\\cdot AE\\cdot AP\\cdot DC+AC\\cdot DB\\cdot AF\\cdot AP=AE\\cdot AD\\cdot AF\\cdot BD +AE\\cdot AD\\cdot AF\\cdot DC\\]\" width=\"570\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a7af74e7156d1e0bb411d34966817e51b43a22.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AB\\cdot AE\\cdot AP\\cdot DC+AC\\cdot DB\\cdot AF\\cdot AP=AE\\cdot AD\\cdot AF\\cdot (BD+DC)\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5ebb3f64d74b1cb6b8b99aec32755e88a4c11fda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AB\\cdot AE\\cdot AP\\cdot DC+AC\\cdot DB\\cdot AF\\cdot AP=AE\\cdot AD\\cdot AF\\cdot (BC)\\]\" width=\"519\" height=\"18\" />\ndividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29dfb1e39bee2b9815d9ac5f3c2d5e0adb0b9fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF\\cdot AE\\cdot AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" /> yields the result\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c11c77788f6b49ee0ce2037332b29089682eb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AB}{AF}\\cdot DC+\\frac{AC}{AE}\\cdot DB=\\frac{AD}{AP}\\cdot BC\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017221909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5827/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:29001:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017221909 and revision id 227461. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}